ces&htidocid=qoIkbF2awEguSllbAAAAAA%3D%3D&hl=en-IN&shem=epsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie&shndl=37&shmd=H4sIAAAAAAAA_xWNMQrCQBAAsc0TrBZLi5wINlpGMOkCibVszjU5OXfD7SXEzj_4DH_lS4zNwBTDJJ9FktdZBeXABIVC7oLjFm4S4OxKjB1UxG62I43kpaeQwvf1hrs0oITBdiAMJ5HW0_LQxdjr3hhVn7YaMTqbWnkYYWpkMnOkf1y0w0C9x0iX7W4zpT2361WNESET1sFHZPucz2F0lhQcQ8FXhz9B0LeWrgAAAA&shmds=v1_ARwrE22MQuXME8AoS-YhXgv6x5HsTfj5avttk4mFKdvEwpx3pQ&source=sh/x/job/li/m1/1#fpstate=tldetail&htivrt=jobs&htiq=Associate+Software+Engineer+Tata+Consultancy+Services&htidocid=qoIkbF2awEguSllbAAAAAA%3D%3D", "thumbnail": "https://serpapi.com/searches/6aca1bc2e6590e62f0b893ed/images/vYod3tQsCSV8ZQCH6accXPqQCiy-_3aSPKKiZ0QzB98.jpeg", "extensions": ["17 days ago", "Full\u2013time"], "source_link": "https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/tcs-pune-is-hiring-for-uipath-senior-developer-at-tata-consultancy-services-4469336627", "job_title": "TCS Pune Is Hiring for UiPath Senior Developer.", "description": "TCS Pune Is Hiring for UiPath Senior Developer.\n\nRole: UiPath Senior Developer.\n\nExperience: 5 - 10 years\n\nLocation: Pune\n\n\n\n\nEducation:\n\nMinimum 15 years of regular, full-time education (10 + 2 + 3) (B. Tech preferred)UiPath Certification (Good to have).\n\n\nJob Role\n\nIn this role, associates will design, develop, and provide support for applications. As part of this dynamic role, he/she will report to Account Service Delivery Lead and work closely with business units and other IT teams to deliver leading edge technology to enable digital capabilities.\n\n\n\n\nSkills:\n\nExperience in Robotics Process Automation development, particularly in UiPath.Independence and work well across different functions.Excellent problem analysis skill. Innovative and creative in developing solutions.Strong sense of drive and commitment to deliver on responsibilities.Strong verbal and written communication skills.Works well in a dynamic environment.\n\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nAnalyze business needs to design, develop and deliver applications to meet business objectives.Provide application maintenance and support in accordance with Service Level Agreement.Deliver applications in accordance with relevant IT policies and procedures.Provide and share technical knowledge with other team members.Implementation of RPA solution using UiPath for Web, thick clients, mainframes, surface automation etc.Agile way of working, knowledge of tools like JIRA, DevOps experience.Ability understand requirement and implement efficient solution in short timeframe to maximize ROI.Stakeholder management ability and good communication skills expected.Developing plug-in APIs using C# or Java to support the automation.Unit testing, SIT support, UAT Support, Hyper care, handover to L3, User training documentation.\n\n\n\n\n\nMandatory Requirements (How to generate your EPCN)\n\nEPCN number is mandatory for eligibility of the interview. Follow the below steps to register :\n\n Step 1: Visit [ https://ibegin.tcsapps.com/candidate/ ] or visit [ https://www.tcs.com/careers ] and click on 'Apply Now'\n\nStep 2: On the I Begin homepage, click on Login (Three dots/lines at top right corner of the homepage to get the option) \n\nStep 3: Click on New User (Register with us) \n\nStep 4: Select \"IT\" in Area of Interest and complete the registration. (Fill in the details) \n\nStep 5: Once completed, your TCS EP ID would be generated which starts with EP2026CNXXXXXXX. Step 6: You will be able to see your EP ID after your login to the I Begin website", "apply_options": [{"title": "LinkedIn", "link": "https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/tcs-pune-is-hiring-for-uipath-senior-developer-at-tata-consultancy-services-4469336627?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic"}, {"title": "BeBee", "link": "https://bebee.com/in/jobs/tcs-pune-is-hiring-for-gen-ai-developer-tata-consultancy-services--talent-638820202149316243?utm_campaign=google_jobs_apply&utm_source=google_jobs_apply&utm_medium=organic"}, {"title": "PrepIntro", "